    <data key="d0">Hexagon Digital Reality Cloud Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Hexagon architecture showcasing VPC Peering between Data account and User Experience/Processing account with S3, EKS, SQS, and AutoScaling.</data>
